Description: A deterministic toolbox for AI agents operating on geospatial
    analysis and data science workflows in R. Provides lightweight spatial and
    tabular data cataloging and inspection, standardized cartographic styles and
    ggplot2 themes, iterative figure versioning with serialized numerical support,
    spatial guardrails (CRS and geometry validation), and reproducible Quarto
    assembly.
